"Yes, for free: open Glow in Safari, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen. It opens full screen like any app, works offline and keeps its own storage. Glow isn't in the App Store, because Apple charges developers 99 US dollars a year to list apps there.": "有，而且免費：在 Safari 中開啟 Glow，點按“共享”，再選擇“新增到主螢幕”。它像普通應用一樣全屏開啟，可離線使用，並擁有獨立儲存。Glow 沒有上架 App Store，因為 Apple 向開發者收取每年 99 美元的上架費用。",
"Yes. Every Glow app opens without internet once you have visited it, and your chats stay on your device. Download Glow Offline in GlowChat (Settings → Offline AI on this device) and GlowChat keeps answering with AI that runs on your device's graphics chip. Web research, the AI crew and cloud models need internet.": "可以。每個 Glow 應用只要訪問過一次就能在沒有網路時開啟，你的聊天記錄保留在你的裝置上。在 GlowChat 中下載 Glow Offline（設定 → 本裝置上的離線 AI），GlowChat 就能用在你裝置顯示卡晶片上執行的 AI 繼續回答。網頁調研、AI 團隊和雲端模型仍需聯網。",
"Yes. Glow, GlowChat, GlowRoom and GlowLead are free with no sign-up. A free Puter sign-in unlocks faster AI models, and the optional Glow Pro plan only raises limits for big missions.": "是的。Glow、GlowChat、GlowRoom 和 GlowLead 均免費，無需註冊。免費登入 Puter 可解鎖更快的 AI 模型，可選的 Glow Pro 套餐只會提高大型任務的額度上限。",
