"You get a new AI tool at work. What do you do first?": "公司給你一個新的 AI 工具，你會先做什麼？",
"You give a goal to GlowLead. GlowLead delegates writing to GlowChat, research and code to the GlowRoom crew, and website steps to browser control. Browser control is Glow Hands on a PC, the Glow Android app's own browser, or the instant cloud browser. All apps share one Glow account and storage in your browser, and use Glow AI.": "你把目標交給 GlowLead。GlowLead 把寫作交給 GlowChat，把調研和程式碼交給 GlowRoom 團隊，把網站操作交給瀏覽器控制。瀏覽器控制可以是電腦上的 Glow Hands、Glow Android 應用自帶的瀏覽器，或即時雲瀏覽器。所有應用共享瀏覽器中的同一個 Glow 帳戶和儲存，並使用 Glow AI。",
